class Solution { fun leafSimilar(root1:TreeNode?,root2:TreeNode?):Boolean{val first=mutableListOf<Int>();val second=mutableListOf<Int>();collect(root1,first);collect(root2,second);return first==second};private fun collect(node:TreeNode?,leaves:MutableList<Int>){if(node==null)return;if(node.left==null&&node.right==null){leaves.add(node.`val`);return};collect(node.left,leaves);collect(node.right,leaves)} }
